  "details": "Please add a gesture menu button to the top left / right of the screen to allow setting left and right hand gestures.\n\nMy idea is that clicking this icon would show 8 more buttons with icons representing the hand gestures so you can access them on the mobile app and do facial things.\n\nThose buttons disappear by choosing a gesture, clicking anything else or after a few seconds.\n\nThe icon of the gesture menu buttons should change to the current active gesture's icon, to always see which gesture is currently active.",
